sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(Claude Desktop / VS Code)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS(edge)
    participant MCP as RHOAI MCP Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RBAC as RBACChecker<br/>(SubjectAccessReview)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>8080/8443 HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Planner as Planner Service<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Agent,K8s: Flow 1: MCP Tool Invocation (OIDC Mode)

    Agent->>Route: POST /mcp (streamable-http)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (JWT)
    Route->>MCP: Forward (TLS terminated)
    MCP->>OIDC: GET /.well-known/openid-configuration<br/>+ JWKS fetch (HTTPS/443)
    OIDC-->>MCP: JWKS keys / token validated
    MCP->>MCP: OIDCAuthMiddleware extracts UserContext
    MCP->>RBAC: filter_tools(user_context)
    RBAC->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview<br/>SA Token + User Impersonation
    K8s-->>RBAC: Allowed/Denied per resource
    RBAC-->>MCP: Filtered tool list
    MCP->>K8s: Domain Plugin CRUD<br/>SA Token + User Impersonation
    K8s-->>MCP: Resource response
    MCP-->>Route: MCP tool result
    Route-->>Agent: JSON response

    Note over MCP,MR: Flow 2: Model Registry Discovery

    MCP->>K8s: List ModelRegistry CRs<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io)
    K8s-->>MCP: Registry namespace
    MCP->>K8s: List Services in registry namespace
    K8s-->>MCP: Service endpoints
    MCP->>MR: GET /api/model_catalog/v1alpha1/models<br/>(probe API type)
    alt Model Catalog detected
        MR-->>MCP: Catalog response (v1alpha1)
    else Fallback to Model Registry
        MCP->>MR: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models
        MR-->>MCP: Registry response (v1alpha3)
    end

    Note over MCP,Planner: Flow 3: Planner Model Recommendation

    MCP->>Planner: POST /api/v1/extract<br/>(extract model requirements)
    Planner-->>MCP: Extracted spec
    MCP->>Planner: POST /api/v1/ranked-recommend-from-spec<br/>(get recommendations)
    Planner-->>MCP: Ranked model list
    MCP->>Planner: POST /api/v1/deploy<br/>(generate deployment config)
    Planner-->>MCP: Deployment configuration
